# web/saas-admin frontend env vars (Vite — only VITE_* are exposed to the bundle).
# Copy to .env.local and customize. .env.local is gitignored.

# Feature flag: cutover /pre-cadastro chat from the in-controlplane Clara handler
# to the new public onboarding tenant (Phases 4-7 of
# docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-20-public-onboarding-tenant.md).
#
# When BOTH variables are set:
#   - POST goes to ${VITE_ONBOARDING_TENANT_URL}/api/public/chat  (202 ack)
#   - SSE stream from ${VITE_ONBOARDING_TENANT_URL}/api/public/chat/stream
#
# Currently the cutover is a STUB — flag is read but the fetch path still uses
# the legacy endpoint. Real cutover requires an SSE event-shape adapter (the
# new endpoint emits {text:"..."}, the hook expects {type:"text",delta:"..."})
# or richer events emitted by publicweb.Channel.Send. See the TODO(Phase 10)
# in src/pages/pre-cadastro/clara/useClaraChat.ts.
#
# VITE_USE_ONBOARDING_TENANT=true
# VITE_ONBOARDING_TENANT_URL=https://onboarding.jotaduo.com
